Package: devjam-gpu-mesa-config
Version: 1.2-1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Mesa optimizations for gl threads, DRI and video decoding/encoding
 Mesa settings through drirc and environment variables: threaded GL,
 no-error contexts, Intel compute class, MPEG-4 VA-API and Vulkan video
 decoding and encoding on the ANV driver.
